<title>HUNGARY: STYL TO SELL 5,000 OWN SHARES.</title>
<headline>STYL TO SELL 5,000 OWN SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian garment factory Styl Ruhagyar Rt said on Friday it had given an order (to a brokerage) for the sale of 5,000 own shares at market price.</p>
<p>On the Budapest Stock Exchange Styl shares ended at 1,700 forints on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
